CompilationUnit
  TypeAlias distinct Email = string requires (> (. it length) 3)
  Struct SignupForm requires (!= password username) at .password
    Field Email email
    Field string username requires (in (. it length) (..= 3 32))
    Field string password requires (in (. it length) (..= 8 128))
    Field i32 age requires (in it (..= 13 120))
